Verse 1:
[C]Jesus loves me! This I know, [F]For the Bible [C]tells me [G]so;
[C]Little ones to Him belong, [F]They are [C]weak but [G]He is [C]strong.
[C]Yes, Jesus [F]loves me! [C]Yes, Jesus [G]loves me!
[C]Yes, Jesus [F]loves me! The [C]Bible [G]tells me [C]so.

Refrain:
[C]Yes, [F]Jesus [C]loves [G]me!
[C][F]Yes, [C]Jesus [G]loves [C]me!
[C]Yes, [F]Jesus [C]loves [G]me!
[C]The [F]Bible [C]tells [G]me [C]so.

Verse 2:
[C]Jesus [F]loves me! [C]He [G]wo died
[C]Heaven's [F]gate [C]to [G]open [C]wide:
[C]He [F]will wash [C]away [G]my sin,
[C]Let [F]His [C]little [G]child [C]come in.

Verse 3:
[C]Jesus, [F]take this [C]heart [G]of mine,
[C]Make [F]it [C]pure [G]and [C]wholly thine;
[C]On [F]the coross [C]You died [G]for me,
[C]I [F]will [C]love and [G]live [C]for Thee.
